              "fill": "#0F172A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 944,
              "content": "纳斯达克跌入修正区间\n华尔街创六个月新低",
              "lineHeight": 1.12,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 60,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "wG6iR",
              "name": "sb5",
              "fill": "#FEF2F2",
              "cornerRadius": 6,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "padding": [
                14,
                18
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Yj2R2",
                  "name": "sbt5",
                  "fill": "#334155",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 908,
                  "content": "3月26日纳斯达克收跌2.38%，正式进入修正区间（较高点跌超10%）。标普500跌1.74%至6,477点，道指跌469点。华尔街创六个月新低。关税政策叠加伊朗战争，投资者信心持续恶化。美国有效关税率已从2025年初的2.2%飙升至10.3%。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 26,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "qerBf",
              "name": "box5",
              "fill": "#EFF6FF",
              "cornerRadius": 6,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": [
                14,
                18
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "7VSLC",
                  "name": "box5t",
                  "fill": "#1E40AF",
                  "content": "📌 投资启示",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "y0YUx",
                  "name": "box5b",
                  "fill": "#334155",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 908,
                  "content": "纳指进入修正区间通常是中期调整的信号而非崩盘前兆。历史数据显示，修正后6个月平均回报为正。但本轮下跌叠加了战争+关税+通胀三重压力，复苏时间可能更长。建议：1）避免恐慌抛售；2）分批建仓优质蓝筹；3）关注防御性板块（公用事业/医疗）。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
